
load @cluesurf/bind/code/rust/std/env
  find consts

task read
  save system, read consts/OS
  save architecture, read consts/ARCH
  send back
    make info
      bind system, read system
      bind architecture, read architecture
      bind name, read system
      bind version, text <>
      bind endian
        fork test, call is-equal, read consts/ENDIAN, text <little>
          hook true
            text <LE>
          hook false
            text <BE>
      bind cores
        call std-thread-available-parallelism
      bind memory, mark 0

task std-thread-available-parallelism
  hide true
  dock call <std::thread::available_parallelism().map(|n| n.get()).unwrap_or(1)>
